[32m+[m[32m# eLingkod Bayan – Los Baños (ELB-LB)[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mAn academic prototype of an **Integrated LGU Management & Citizen Services System**. The target MVP connects citizen reports and service requests to a small LGU dashboard, with public directories, municipal projects, worker census records, and deterministic job matching.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Read this before setup[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe repository already contains an application. At review on **20 October 2026**, it contained Next.js 16.4.2, React/React DOM 19.3.0, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS 4, shadcn/ui with a Base UI preset, landing sections, login/register forms, and MySQL/Prisma/Better Auth integration code. These observations come from source and package inspection, not a successful runtime test. The previous README's frontend-only description no longer matched all the source files.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe approved backend is **Supabase PostgreSQL, Auth, and Storage**. The source has **not** been converted by this documentation task. Follow the [existing-project migration checkpoint](docs/02-installation-and-environment-setup.md#existing-project-migration-checkpoint) before treating Supabase setup as complete. Do not scaffold over this checkout or combine the old MySQL setup with the new plan.[m
