[32m+[m[32m## MVP scope and limitations[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mAll six features need a small working demonstration. P0 covers persistent core workflows and security; P1 covers directories, filtering, and sample import. P2 enhancements must not consume the testing window.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe MVP does not issue permits, collect payments, dispatch responders, perform hiring transactions, or use AI matching. It has no municipal endorsement or verified operational SLA. Use synthetic data and label illustrative content. Unverified hotline entries remain non-callable; do not invent numbers.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe existing [brand/UI guide](BRAND-AND-UI-GUIDE.txt) remains useful: retain the eLB mark, Poppins, navy/gold palette, responsive layouts, and honest demo labels. Landing images are illustrations, not records of government activities. Preserve the fixed-year footer handling until the team verifies an alternative with the current cache configuration.[m
